@startuml navigation_user_journey_diagram
title Frontend - Navigation and user journey

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #fffaf2
  BorderColor #4b3f2f
  ArrowColor #4b3f2f
  FontColor #2f2516
}

[*] --> HomePage

state "HomePage\nAccueil + catalogue" as HomePage
state "PatternPage\nDemo + UML + pedagogie" as PatternPage
state "PatternQuizPage\nQuiz d un pattern" as PatternQuizPage
state "QuizDashboardPage\nProgression utilisateur" as QuizDashboardPage
state "AuthDialog\nConnexion / inscription" as AuthDialog
state "VisualizationModal\nScene / UML agrandis" as VisualizationModal
state "NotFoundPage" as NotFoundPage

HomePage --> PatternPage : choisir un pattern
HomePage --> AuthDialog : connexion / inscription
HomePage --> QuizDashboardPage : navbar \"Ma progression\"

PatternPage --> HomePage : retour accueil
PatternPage --> PatternPage : changer de pattern
PatternPage --> VisualizationModal : ouvrir scene ou UML
VisualizationModal --> PatternPage : fermer la modal

PatternPage --> PatternQuizPage : ouvrir le quiz\nsi utilisateur connecte
PatternPage --> AuthDialog : ouvrir le quiz\nsi utilisateur non connecte

PatternQuizPage --> PatternPage : retour au pattern
PatternQuizPage --> QuizDashboardPage : progression apres validation
PatternQuizPage --> AuthDialog : session absente / expirée

QuizDashboardPage --> PatternQuizPage : repasser un quiz
QuizDashboardPage --> PatternPage : ouvrir un pattern
QuizDashboardPage --> HomePage : retour accueil
QuizDashboardPage --> AuthDialog : acces protege si non connecte

AuthDialog --> HomePage : fermer sans action
AuthDialog --> PatternPage : reprendre le pattern courant
AuthDialog --> PatternQuizPage : continuer le quiz apres login
AuthDialog --> QuizDashboardPage : ouvrir la progression apres login

HomePage --> NotFoundPage : route inconnue
PatternPage --> NotFoundPage : code pattern invalide
PatternQuizPage --> NotFoundPage : code pattern invalide
QuizDashboardPage --> NotFoundPage : route invalide
NotFoundPage --> HomePage : retour accueil

note right of HomePage
Point d entree principal :
- presentation du projet
- filtre catalogue
- acces aux patterns
- entree vers auth
end note

note right of PatternPage
Boucle pedagogique centrale :
configurer -> visualiser -> executer -> comprendre -> lancer le quiz
end note

note right of PatternQuizPage
Page reservee aux utilisateurs connectes.
Elle alimente la progression persistante.
end note

note bottom of QuizDashboardPage
Vue portfolio / suivi :
scores, badges, progression par pattern.
end note

@enduml
